{"municipality_code":"14113","pref":"神奈川県","city":"横浜市緑区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜市緑区には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「東耕地遺跡」、「神明神社」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 「神奈川県立四季の森公園」や「横浜動物の森公園」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":76,"rank":714,"percentile":62.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":114,"rank":175,"percentile":90.7,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":9,"rank":1681,"percentile":9.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":7,"rank":1128,"percentile":34.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":16,"rank":914,"percentile":50.2,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["神奈川県立四季の森公園","横浜動物の森公園","植